        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc/models/2026-delphi10000-emiliania-huxleyi-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L324-L372> .
